  <h2>About Window Film Philadelphia — Professional Window Tinting Since 2008</h2>
  <p>Window Film Philadelphia is the Philadelphia office of a window film company founded in 2008. We install professional window film for residential, commercial, and institutional properties across Philadelphia and the Delaware Valley. Our certified installation team applies solar control, UV protection, glare reduction, privacy, security, anti-graffiti, safety, decorative, blast mitigation, and ballistic-resistant window film to existing glass — no replacement required. We serve Center City, Old City, South Philly, Fishtown, Northern Liberties, Manayunk, University City, King of Prussia, Camden NJ, Reading PA, Upper Darby PA, and the broader Delaware Valley. Licensed and insured in Pennsylvania and New Jersey. Contact Window Film Philadelphia for a free consultation.</p>
